  <h2>Scope</h2>
  <p>This policy explains how Cooked Finance handles information when you use cookedfinance.com. The site works without an account, bank connection, or server-side personal profile.</p>

  <h2>Calculator information</h2>
  <p>Values entered into home-energy, repair-versus-replace, and money calculators are processed by code in your browser. They are not placed in the page URL or intentionally attached to analytics events.</p>

  <h2>My Home local storage</h2>
  <p>My Home saves item names, categories, optional model and notes, service dates, next-due dates, and creation time under <code>cooked-finance-home-plan-v1</code> in browser <code>localStorage</code>. The record stays on that browser and device until you delete it or clear browser storage. Cooked Finance cannot see, synchronize, or restore it.</p>
  <p>The original financial check stores a result only when you explicitly choose its save control. Its saved values likewise remain in that browser.</p>

  <h2>Exports</h2>
  <p>My Home can create JSON and calendar files on your device. Exporting is your choice. Once imported, copied, emailed, or stored elsewhere, those files are governed by the destination you choose.</p>

  <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
  <p>Google Analytics loads only after “Allow Analytics” is selected. When allowed, it may process the page visited, referrer, browser and device information, approximate location, cookies, and online identifiers. Calculator values, saved-home records, model numbers, notes, due dates, financial values, and result bands are not intentionally included.</p>
  <p>Your choice is kept locally under <code>cooked-finance-analytics-choice</code>. Use “Privacy Choices” in the footer to change it. Selecting “Essential Only” prevents future analytics loading in that browser; previously created third-party cookies may require a reload or browser deletion.</p>

  <h2>Hosting and security logs</h2>
  <p>Hosting and network providers may process ordinary request data such as IP address, URL, timestamp, user agent, and security signals to deliver and protect the site. Calculator fields are not part of those requests.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>The site currently displays no paid advertising and loads no AdSense code. Before advertising is introduced, this policy, consent controls, and the <a href="/advertising-policy/">advertising policy</a> will be reviewed and updated.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul><li>Use every calculator without saving.</li><li>Delete individual My Home items or the complete local plan.</li><li>Export a local backup before clearing storage.</li><li>Choose Essential Only for optional analytics.</li><li>Clear site data through browser settings.</li></ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
